+//
+// If ART_USE_SIMULATOR is defined then the compiled Arm64 entrypoint file is transformed into an
+// x86_64 format ELF file that still contains Arm64 code. This allows it to be linked to the x86_64
+// libart and its Arm64 code later simulated using the ART simulator.
+//
